# Artist-dispatch packets — Iteration 2 sweat batches (2026-11-21)

Packets are recorded in artist-dispatch form: one artist from the roster of
record, a frame range, one operation, reference points, a done-definition,
and a return coordinate. The seats are not all awake; packets are
store-and-forward records and the workshop work itself ran as ranch-side
CPU/frame work and still generation. Uptake is verified from the returned
artifacts filed beside this document, never from say-so. The arc-sketch
reference for both packets is the Iteration 2 agenda itself (animator skill
ITERATIONS.md, "Iteration 2 — agenda as briefed", 2026-11-21).

## Packet 2.1 — composition conform + anchor enumeration

- **Packet id:** I2-B21
- **Artist:** Velum — Scroll Central (7.1 SC), velum@mirrorborn.us
- **Subject:** `ex01-ignition-v2.mp4` (240 frames, 1152×768, 24 fps) — frame
  surface: frames 000–239 of the clip as filed in this folder.
- **Operation A (frames 000–059):** measure each frame's composition offset
  against frame 000 (phase correlation) and apply a counter-crop conform;
  return the corrected frames plus the measured offset per frame.
- **Operation B (frames 060–239):** verify identity anchors per frame —
  Fern's buns, scarf bow, key-badge; Waverly's gold streak, plum coat —
  present or absent, ENUMERATED (every frame), not sampled.
- **Done-definition:** a per-frame offset table for 000–059 with corrected
  frames re-assembled; a per-frame anchor table for 060–239 with zero
  unexamined frames; any frame failing an anchor named individually.
- **Return coordinate:** `series/animation-exercises/batch-2.1/` in
  wbic16/scrolltown@exo (this filing).
- **Returned:** `offsets-000-059.csv` (translation ≈0; see QC-v3 for the
  scale finding in `scale-000-059.txt`), `corrected-000-059.mp4`,
  `anchors-060-239.csv` (180/180 on all five anchors), `sheets/`,
  `cropsheets/`. Verdicts in QC-v3.md.

## Packet 2.2 — variant stills for intro keyframes 5–8

- **Packet id:** I2-B22
- **Artist:** Alveus — Rock Mountain (7.2 RM), alveus@mirrorborn.us
- **Subject:** FERN-KEYFRAMES-MJ.md frames 5 (River of Pages), 6 (badge-check
  at Mrs. Hen's door), 7 (Reading Tree), 8 (wave goodbye) — the four frames
  Will has not yet rendered.
- **Operation:** generate one variant still per frame, seeded from the
  canonical Fern reference (`series/fern-reference.png`), following each
  frame's prompt and likeness check in FERN-KEYFRAMES-MJ.md.
- **Done-definition:** four stills, each passing its frame's likeness check
  on Emise's read (Fern front and canonical; the frame's named check —
  wheel visible / eyes closed + seal unbroken / listening mood + unreadable
  page / wave reads + dusk warm + every window lit), filed as DRAFTS —
  drafts are inputs to Emise's and Will's likeness check, never canon.
- **Return coordinate:** `series/animation-exercises/batch-2.2/` in
  wbic16/scrolltown@exo (this filing).
- **Returned:** four DRAFT stills + `LIKENESS.md` verdicts (all four pass at
  draft grade; two staging notes). See QC-v3.md summary.
